  "content": "<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2GB3QhtXb4I?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p><p><span>本模组最初由 SonicJumper 制作（原帖可在 </span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/wip-mods/1442984-1-6-2-enhanced-visuals-v0-3-deprecated-updated-8\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a><span> 找到）。</span></p><p>EnhancedVisuals 通过在 HUD 中添加特效，提供更沉浸的体验。</p><p><strong>Optifine</strong><br>要将 EnhancedVisuals 与 Optifine 同时使用，必须关闭快速渲染（Fast Render）、各向异性过滤（Anisotropic Filtering）和抗锯齿（Antialiasing）。否则，当某些特效激活时，屏幕会变黑。</p><p><strong>资源包<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhancedvisual-pixelated\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals 像素化</a><br>（已过时）nox_cgt 制作的像素化 EnhancedVisuals <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhiypntguq6ry40h%252fPixelated%2bEnhancedVisuals%2bby%2bnox_cgt.zip%253fdl%253d1\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">正在寻找与朋友一起游玩的服务器？我们的赞助商已为您准备就绪：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"237\" height=\"77\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">使用促销码 <strong>teamcreative</strong>，可在任意游戏服务器的首月享受 25% 折扣！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Y8zkibd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"377\" height=\"212\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/5OFKGb1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"213\"></p><p><strong>关联模组：<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToughAsNails</a>&nbsp;和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpledifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleDifficulty</a></strong></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjOViAN-N4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"61\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"154\" height=\"75\"></a></p>",
